abstract: >-
  A governed and refreshable Microsoft Excel business-intelligence project
  that transforms Superstore order-line data through Power Query ETL,
  a relational Power Pivot model, explicit DAX measures, data-quality controls,
  interactive PivotTables, charts, slicers and timelines.
